Added in this fork
------------------

- ontowiki/
  Ontology-constrained compiler, bi-temporal SQLite store, optional Graphiti
  mirror, lint review, progressive query, eval harness, MCP server, and the
  bundled agent-research corpus.
- tests/ontowiki/
  Tests for the compiler, store, lint, query, MCP tools, eval artifact, and
  timeline artifact.
- web/src/app/ontowiki/
  Timeline route.
- web/src/components/ontowiki/
  Timeline scrubber and force-graph view.
- web/src/lib/ontowiki/
  Client-side snapshot of the graph at a chosen date.
- web/src/data/ontowiki-timeline.json
  Generated timeline. Regenerated by `python -m ontowiki demo`.
- web/public/ontowiki/
  Screenshots of the timeline demo.
- web/src/app/page.tsx
  Landing-page link to the timeline.
- .github/workflows/test.yml
  OntoWiki pytest job.
- Makefile
  ontowiki-test, ontowiki-eval, and ontowiki-demo targets.
- README.md
  Rewritten around OntoWiki, in English and Chinese.

Unchanged upstream
------------------

api/, mcp/, converter/, extension/, docker/, and the rest of web/ remain
the upstream llmwiki project. Local and hosted wiki behavior is unchanged
aside from the landing-page link above.
